=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : 5 reads bound as StateFlow via StatisticsPageViewModel -> statisticsPageSourceOf(): EnergyStore.batteryHealthAnalytics
               (web useBatteryHealthAnalytics), AnalyticsStore.fleetAnalytics(30)/mileageStats/stateSummary (web useFleetAnalytics/useMileageStats/useStateSummary),
               and the page-local StatisticsExtrasRepository.periodStats over the shared ApiHttpClient + CacheStore (web bare useQuery /analytics/period-stats).
               Scope = SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle); units/currency = SettingsStore.settings() (web useUnits/useFormatting). No HTTP in the view.
charts       : RadialGauge + 2x ChartContainer + BarChartWrapper from the A3 components.charts library; the pie is a Compose-Canvas donut+legend authored in the
               page (A3 ships no pie wrapper) — Compose-native, never a webview.
si/units     : SI read off the wire; distance via convertDistanceFromSI(km*1000) at the display boundary (prefs.fromKm), efficiency Wh/km->Wh/mi via prefs.whPerKmToDisplay,
               currency via the user's settings symbol/precision/locale. No miles/mph/kWh stored or computed; energy kWh + CO2 kg rendered verbatim (web parity).
states       : period-stats is the PRIMARY gate (loading/empty/error/success). Each secondary feed renders its own content-or-empty surface, so no section is ever hidden
               (web per-section truthiness). Documented divergence (Honesty #9): an all-zero / no-vehicle payload routes to the friendly empty surface via the model hasData gate.
a11y/theme   : charts carry accessibleDescription (the web aria-labels); the bar exposes the screen-reader data table; the pie legend is TalkBack-readable; gauge has a merged
               contentDescription; icons decorative (contentDescription=null); all color via MaterialTheme.colorScheme + chart ChartPalette + TeslaTokens.status (A2 tokens) —
               dynamic color + dark theme; typography via the role components (PageTitle/PanelTitle/BodyText/Caption/MetricValue). Compose-native (no webview).
nav          : Destinations 'statistics' -> /statistics pre-existing (Destinations.kt L89, count unchanged); host wired via PageHosts.register("statistics"); deep link
               auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost. DataContainer widened with EnergyStore + the api/cacheStore accessors the page-local period-stats repo needs (A7 DI seam).
